step Expert Enchanting
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Enchanting 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Kitta Firewind (Elwynn Forest); Horde Hgarth (Stonetalon Mountains). This route trains it at Kitta Firewind (Elwynn Forest) for the Alliance and Hgarth (Stonetalon Mountains) for the Horde, who also teach the recipes of 150-225: one trainer for every visit. Learn now: Runed Golden Rod (from 150). 150-225 takes 1 Iridescent Pearl, 1 Black Pearl, 1 Greater Astral Essence, 55 Soul Dust, 1 Golden Rod, 10 Lesser Mystic Essence, 1 Greater Mystic Essence, 21 Vision Dust and 1 Truesilver Rod to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility (from 160), Enchant Chest - Greater Intellect (from 185), Runed Truesilver Rod (from 200) and Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (from 205), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 4.
  level 20
  train Enchanting Expert npc 11072 only Alliance
  train Enchanting Expert npc 11074 only Horde
  learn 13628 npc 11072 only Alliance
  learn 13628 npc 11074 only Horde

step Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina to 160
  tip Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina is orange at 150 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 11 crafts to 160, up to 12 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Soul Dust. One Soul Dust a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the Runed Golden Rod now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. If you got here without learning Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it.
  learn 13501
  craft 13628 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 13501 until 160

step Enchanting recipes at 160
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility (from 160).
  learn 13637 npc 11072 only Alliance
  learn 13637 npc 11074 only Horde

step Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility to 195
  tip Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 39 crafts to 195, up to 42 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Soul Dust. Soul Dust again. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one.
  craft 13637 until 195

step Enchanting recipes at 195
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Enchant Chest - Greater Intellect (from 185).
  learn 13663 npc 11072 only Alliance
  learn 13663 npc 11074 only Horde

step Enchant Chest - Greater Intellect to 205
  tip Enchant Chest - Greater Intellect is orange at 195 (yellow 205, green 225, grey 245): about 10 crafts to 205, a point every craft. Each takes 1 Lesser Mystic Essence. One Lesser Mystic Essence a craft (weapons of level 31-40 break into essences); orange to 205, a point every craft. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one.
  craft 13663 until 205

step Enchanting recipes at 205
  tip Still at the Expert trainer: Runed Truesilver Rod (from 200) and Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense (from 205).
  learn 13702 npc 11072 only Alliance
  learn 13702 npc 11074 only Horde
  learn 13746 npc 11072 only Alliance
  learn 13746 npc 11074 only Horde

step Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense to 225
  tip Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 245, grey 265): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 1 Vision Dust. One Vision Dust a craft (level 31-40 greens). Make the Runed Truesilver Rod first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Black Pearl (1 for 150-225): Black Pearl is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. Enchanting 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 13702 x1 -- a tool: keep it in your bags
  craft 13746 until 225
  skill Enchanting 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Enchanting 225-300

step Artisan Enchanting
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Enchanting 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Annora teaches Artisan Enchanting inside the Uldaman dungeon (Badlands); bring a group. Learn now: Enchant Gloves - Agility (from 210). 225-300 takes about 2g 20s of recipes and 1g 70s of vendor goods, plus 41 Purple Lotus, 45 Vision Dust and 233 Dream Dust to gather or buy.
  level 35
  train 11073
  learn 13815 npc 11073

step Enchanting 225-300: vendor goods
  tip Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 34 Crystal Vial (1g 70s); about 1g 70s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction (Stormwind City: Edna Mullby, Eldraeith and Jasper Fel; Orgrimmar: Felika, Kor'geld and Rekkul).
  buy 8925 x34 nearest

step Formula: Lesser Mana Oil
  tip Formula: Lesser Mana Oil teaches Lesser Mana Oil (Enchanting 250) for 1g. Sold by Kania (Silithus).
  buy 20754 nearest

step Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina
  tip Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina teaches Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina (Enchanting 265) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: Mythrin'dir (Darnassus), limited stock; Horde: Daniel Bartlett (Undercity), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it.
  buy 16217 nearest

step Get Purple Lotus
  tip 41 Purple Lotus for Enchanting 225-300: 41 Lesser Mana Oils. Herbalism: Purple Lotus (skill 210) in The Hinterlands (40-50), Feralas (40-50) and Azshara (45-55). The window lists the Herbalism areas for your level, best first: the arrow leads to the one you pick and rests there until your bags hold them. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 8831 x41 gather Herbalism 210
