  auction 11137 x45

step Get Dream Dust · Disenchant: Professions tab (K by default)
  tip 233 Dream Dust for Enchanting 225-300: 41 Lesser Mana Oils and 32 Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina. Enchanting: disenchant green armour that requires level 41-50. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 11176 x233 anywhere gather Enchanting 1 levels 41-50
  auction 11176 x233

step Enchant Gloves - Agility to 253
  tip Enchant Gloves - Agility is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 250, grey 270): about 39 crafts to 253, up to 45 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Vision Dust. Annora teaches it with Artisan: learn it on that visit. Vision Dust again; bring about 40. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one.
  craft 13815 until 253

step Lesser Mana Oil to 275
  tip Lesser Mana Oil is orange at 253 (yellow 260, green 270, grey 280): about 34 crafts to 275, up to 41 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 1 Dream Dust, 1 Purple Lotus and 1 Crystal Vial. One Dream Dust (level 41-50 greens) and one Purple Lotus (herbalists) a craft; the oil sells well. Kania sells the formula at the inn of Cenarion Hold (Silithus): fly there, the mobs around it are level 55 and up.
  learn 25127 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 25127 until 275

step Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina to 300
  tip Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina is orange at 275 (yellow 285, green 305, grey 325): about 29 crafts to 300, up to 32 for 9 players in 10 (the gathered materials above count that many). Each takes 6 Dream Dust. Six Dream Dust a craft: the dearest stretch, so disenchant every level 41-50 green you find. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. Enchanting 300 is a Legacy System milestone.
  learn 20017 -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 20017 until 300
  skill Enchanting 300
